lready a palindrome or no such character exists, print .  Sample Input  3 aaab baa aaa Sample Output  3 0 -1 Explanation  Test Case 1: \"aaab\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 2: \"baa\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 3: \"aaa\"  This string is already a palindrome, so we print ; however, , , and  are also all acceptable answers, as the string will still be a palindrome if any one of the characters at those indices are removed.","topics":[],"score":211922,"global_rank":273533},{"name":"zdelacerda/Movie-Finder","owner":"zdelacerda","html_url":"https://github.com/zdelacerda/Movie-Finder","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"A program that notifies you, by text or email, about showtimes for potentially interesting movies playing at your favorite cinema.","topics":[],"score":211913,"global_rank":273566},{"name":"Avynn/Cat-GAN","owner":"Avynn","html_url":"https://github.com/Avynn/Cat-GAN","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"a generative adverserial network created to identify and generate cats","topics":[],"score":211906,"global_rank":273576},{"name":"aaron-imbrock/keepassxc-wrapper","owner":"aaron-imbrock","html_url":"https://github.com/aaron-imbrock/keepassxc-wrapper","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"webdav wrapper for keepassxc","topics":[],"score":211903,"global_rank":273581},{"name":"bishan-batel/cs330-lexical-permutation","owner":"bishan-batel","html_url":"https://github.com/bishan-batel/cs330-lexical-permutation","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":211903,"global_rank":273587}]